  "details": "1. Open VRChat Windows (Steam).\n\n2. Log into an account with a custom status. NOT color (Online, Away, Offline), In my case, Online with custom text.\n\n3. Log Out.\n\n4. Log into a new account, In my case, created during the account switch process.\n\n5. Open the Quick Menu\n\nNext to the clock, it will display the new account Name and Profile Picture, but the Old Account Status.\n\n(Note, This is a visual only bug, and does not have any bearing on gameplay or account information, Its local only as well, and does not actually change the status of the new account.)\n\n((POSSIBLE* Could be related to cache failing to properly clear with the new account, using old Cache data))",
